          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "منفجر شدن (monfajer shodan) — \"to explode, to blow up\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "کپسول گاز در آشپزخانه منفجر شد. Kapsul-e gâz dar âshpazkhâne monfajer shod. The gas cylinder exploded in the kitchen."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Present monfajer mishavad; monfajer kardan is \"to blow something up\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "monfajer is usually traced to Arabic munfajir, \"bursting\", of the same root as enfejâr; EtymDB lists no entry. shodan \"to become\" is inherited Persian."
            }
          ]
        },
