              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ترکیدن (tarakidan) — \"to burst, to crack\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "لوله آب در زمستان ترکید. Lule-ye âb dar zemestân tarakid. The water pipe burst in the winter."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Spoken terekidan. Present stem tarak-: mitarakad, in speech mitereke. Also of a balloon or a tyre."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "tarakidan is a native Persian verb, built with the verb suffix -idan; its deeper origin is not settled, and EtymDB lists no entry."
            }
          ]
        },
